// Rule: [T1098.005] Passkey Cloud Compromise - MFA Method Addition
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1098.005
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: CloudAppEvents
// Purpose: Hunts a successful identity update in which the number of MFA device records increases between the published old and new authentication-method snapshots.
// Logic: Evaluate CloudAppEvents for mfa method addition using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A match proves only that an MFA device record was added.
// A match does not prove: successful exploitation, malicious ownership, downstream impact, campaign attribution or complete compromise without corroborating evidence.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Actor-controlled MFA method addition
// Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: CloudAppEvents populated by Microsoft Defender for Cloud Apps
// Source evidence: Microsoft observed actors adding a phone, authenticator app,
// or software OTP token and published this OldValue/NewValue comparison.
// A match proves only that an MFA device record was added. Validate ownership.
CloudAppEvents
| where ActionType == "Update user."
| where tostring(RawEventData.ResultStatus) == "Success"
| where RawEventData has_any
    ("StrongAuthenticationPhoneAppDetail", "StrongAuthenticationUserDetails")
| extend AccountObjectId = extract(@"User_([a-f0-9\-]+)", 1,
    tostring(RawEventData.Target))
| where isnotempty(AccountObjectId)
| mv-expand ModifiedProp = RawEventData.ModifiedProperties
| where tostring(ModifiedProp.Name) in
    ("StrongAuthenticationPhoneAppDetail", "StrongAuthenticationUserDetails")
| extend OldValue = tostring(ModifiedProp.OldValue),
         NewValue = tostring(ModifiedProp.NewValue)
| extend OldDeviceCount = countof(OldValue, @"""Id"""),
         NewDeviceCount = countof(NewValue, @"""Id""")
| where NewDeviceCount > OldDeviceCount
| project Timestamp, AccountObjectId, AccountId, AccountDisplayName,
    IPAddress, Application, ActionType, OldDeviceCount, NewDeviceCount,
    OldValue, NewValue, ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
